      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "古人观察到：彩虹藏起来了（冰雪代替了雨）、天上的气上升、地下的气下降。",
        "en": "Ancient texts: rainbows hide (ice replaces rain), heaven's air rises, earth's air descends."
      },
      "region": [
